<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's est receipts 100,000, Wk ago 107,000, and Yr ago 104,000 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded mostly $0.50 lower than mid-session Monday. Trade was slow for light demand and offerings. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   County		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    54.00 -55.00	   55.00 -56.00</p>
<p>			   55.50 -56.00	   56.50 -57.00</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>260-280 lbs	    53.00 -55.00	   53.50 -56.00</p>
<p>US 2-4   43-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>280-300 lbs	    53.00 -55.00	   53.50 -56.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00 -44.00	   42.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00 -46.00	   43.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.00 -49.00</p>
